msgstr "{server} 无法连接 {host}"

#. A seat's opening failed: the team server did not start the person's seat and said no more; {server} is the server's name
#: src/places.ts
msgid "{server} could not start your seat"
msgstr "{server} 无法启动你的席位"

#. A seat's opening failed: the team server did not start the person's seat; {server} is the server's name, {words} its own words, kept whole
#: src/places.ts
