msgstr "{server} 拒绝了这个席位"

#. A seat's opening refused by the team server, its refusal relayed from it or from the instance; {server} is the server's name, {words} its own words, kept whole
#: src/places.ts
msgid "{server} refused the seat: {words}"
msgstr "{server} 拒绝了这个席位：{words}"

#. A seat's opening failed: the team server's TLS certificate did not verify against the trusted certificate authorities, so nothing was sent to it; {server} is the server's name
#: src/places.ts
msgid "{server}'s certificate could not be verified"
msgstr "无法验证 {server} 的证书"

#. Refusal where the folder chosen for the example already holds files
#: src/forge.ts
msgid "{target} is not empty; the example seeds only a new or empty directory"
msgstr "{target} 不是空目录；示例只能填充新建或空的目录"

#. Storage diagnostic: a host URL is not an instance's origin written canonically — http or https (http on localhost or 127.x alone), a lowercase host of DNS labels (letters, digits and inner hyphens) joined by single dots, and a port from 1 to 65535 other than the scheme's default, nothing else; the URL is shown with any user info as …
#: src/i18n.ts
msgid "{url} is not an instance's origin"
msgstr "{url} 不是实例的源地址"

#. Refusal of a write: the file it would replace changed since it was read; {what} names the file or folder
#. Refusal of a write: the file it would replace changed since it was read; {what} names the file or folder
#. Refusal of a write: the file it would replace changed since it was read; {what} names the file or folder
#: src/service.ts
#: src/space.ts
msgid "{what} changed meanwhile; retry"
msgstr "{what} 已在此期间更改；请重试"

#. One settings drift; `who` is itself a message and `field` the config file's own field name
#: src/session.ts
msgid "{who}'s {field} changed"
msgstr "{who} 的 {field} 已更改"

#. Draft thread status line: the compile was canceled; the ◇ stays
