msgstr "◇ 编译中 — 由你发起"

#. Draft thread status line; {kind} is the directive's code word (compile, register or spex) and the ◇ stays
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "◇ Could not read the agent's {kind} block — sent to the agent"
msgstr "◇ 无法读取智能体的 {kind} 代码块 — 已发送给智能体"

#. Draft thread status line; {kind} is the directive's code word (compile, register or spex) and the ◇ stays
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "◇ Could not read the agent's {kind} block — three in a row; tell the agent how to proceed"
msgstr "◇ 无法读取智能体的 {kind} 代码块 — 已连续三次；请告诉智能体如何继续"

#. Draft thread status line; {kind} is the directive's code word (compile, register or spex) and the ◇ stays
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "◇ Could not read the agent's {kind} block — waiting for your queued message"
msgstr "◇ 无法读取智能体的 {kind} 代码块 — 正在等待你已排队的消息"

#. Draft thread status line: a roster player now answers, named by its id; the ◇ stays
#: src/authoring.ts
