msgstr "代码主机的凭据是一个令牌，主机需要时再加一个用户名"

#. Refusal of a code host's credential on a team server's seat: the token or the username holds a line break or another control character
#: src/service.ts
msgid "A code host's token and username are each one line of text"
msgstr "代码主机的令牌和用户名都只能是一行文本"

#. Refusal: another compile of this core writes the playbook's artifact folder
#: src/compile.ts
msgid "a compile is writing {folder}; retry once it ends"
msgstr "一个编译正在写入 {folder}；请在它结束后重试"

#. Refusal of a credential on a team server's seat: the host's or the agent's name, or a variable's name, is blank
#: src/service.ts
msgid "A credential needs a name"
msgstr "凭据需要一个名称"

#. Refusal of a credential on a team server's seat: a token, a username or an agent's value is blank, or none is given
#: src/service.ts
msgid "A credential's value cannot be blank"
msgstr "凭据的值不能为空"

#. Refusal during attachment admission
#: src/service.ts
msgid "A dispatched intent's content is history."
msgstr "已派发的意图内容属于历史记录。"

#. Refusal: work already sent cannot be reworded
#: src/service.ts
